notes               = "Untitled in source. A formal quatrain — monorhymed on -āb (مهتاب / بی‌تاب / آب) — set among free verse, and the first of a cluster of metrical poems in this stretch of the book (see also pages 133-134, 196, 197, 199). Dated by decade rather than year, like page 74. دههٔ ۱۳۷۰ is the Solar Hijri 1370s = 1991-2001. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben."
